start: mr
R1: 4ch=tr 23tr@ring join
R2: sc@same [7ch 2sk sc]x7 7ch 2sk join
R3: sl@sp {3ch=dc 6dc}@same [{dc 9ch dc}@sp 7dc@sp]x3 {dc 9ch dc}@sp join
R4: 3sl {3ch=dc 5ch dc}@same [{5dc 5ch 5dc}@sp {dc 5ch dc}@st]x3 {5dc 5ch 5dc}@sp ss@top # ch 8 = 1 dc + ch 5; second group in centre dc of next 7-dc group
R5: sl@sp {4ch=tr 6tr}@same [3ch 13tr@sp 3ch 7tr@sp]x3 3ch 13tr@sp 3ch join
R6: 4ch=tr ch [tr ch]x5 tr [3ch [tr ch]x6 {tr 5ch tr}@st [ch tr]x6 3ch [tr ch]x6 tr]x3 3ch [tr ch]x6 {tr 5ch tr}@st [ch tr]x6 3ch ss@top # ch 5 = 1 tr + ch 1
R7: sl@sp sc@same [[3ch sc@sp]x5 4ch sk [sc@sp 3ch]x5 [sc@sp 5ch]x2 [sc@sp 3ch]x5 4ch sk sc@sp]x3 [3ch sc@sp]x5 4ch sk [sc@sp 3ch]x5 [sc@sp 5ch]x2 [sc@sp 3ch]x5 4ch sk join
R8: sl@sp sc@same [[3ch sc@sp]x4 5ch sk [sc@sp 3ch]x4 sc@sp [5ch sc@sp]x3 [3ch sc@sp]x4 5ch sk sc@sp]x3 [3ch sc@sp]x4 5ch sk [sc@sp 3ch]x4 sc@sp [5ch sc@sp]x3 [3ch sc@sp]x4 5ch sk join
R9: sl@sp sc@same [[3ch sc@sp]x3 6ch sk [sc@sp 3ch]x3 [sc@sp 5ch]x2 {tr 5ch tr 5ch}@sp sc@sp 5ch [sc@sp 3ch]x3 sc@sp 6ch sk sc@sp]x3 [3ch sc@sp]x3 6ch sk [sc@sp 3ch]x3 [sc@sp 5ch]x2 {tr 5ch tr 5ch}@sp sc@sp 5ch [sc@sp 3ch]x3 sc@sp 6ch sk join
R10: sl@sp sc@same [[3ch sc@sp]x2 7ch sk [sc@sp 3ch]x2 sc@sp 7ch sk [sc@sp 7ch]x3 sk [sc@sp 3ch]x2 sc@sp 7ch sk sc@sp]x3 [3ch sc@sp]x2 7ch sk [sc@sp 3ch]x2 sc@sp 7ch sk [sc@sp 7ch]x3 sk [sc@sp 3ch]x2 sc@sp 7ch sk join
R11: sl@sp sc@same 3ch sc@sp 9ch sk sc@sp 3ch sc@sp [9ch sk sc@sp 15ch sc@sp [9ch sk sc@sp 3ch sc@sp]x3]x3 9ch sk sc@sp 15ch sc@sp 9ch sk sc@sp 3ch sc@sp 9ch sk join fo
